            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Presentation</h2><br>Thorne: Tales of The Crow is a character-driven, episodic RPG developed by a Brazilian Indie company and published by RPG veterans Aldorlea Games, <br>Each episode tells a different tale of Thorne, an infamous mercenary known as The Crow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>Thorne finds himself in chains for a murder he did not commit, which is unusual. The explanation to the facts that led him to his arrest unveils the sinister truth of Hollow Lake, a nearby village crippled by corruption. <br>Play as an infamous mercenary known as &quot;The Crow&quot; in a decayed and corrupt world, find your way out of chains and get paid for your contract.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>- Explore a corrupt and dark world, meet ambiguous and interesting characters, judge them as friends or foes.<br>- Fight against magical creatures, wild beasts, cursed monsters, witches, sorcerers and professional hunters who are after the prize for your head.<br>- Make your character progression as you wish. Choose from a vast variety of accessories that best serve you in combat.<br>- Be &quot;The Crow&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the sequel</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blood Knot, from the same developer</h2><br>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Presentation</h2><br>Thorne: Tales of The Crow is a character-driven, episodic RPG developed by a Brazilian Indie company and published by RPG veterans Aldorlea Games, <br>Each episode tells a different tale of Thorne, an infamous mercenary known as The Crow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>Thorne finds himself in chains for a murder he did not commit, which is unusual. The explanation to the facts that led him to his arrest unveils the sinister truth of Hollow Lake, a nearby village crippled by corruption. <br>Play as an infamous mercenary known as &quot;The Crow&quot; in a decayed and corrupt world, find your way out of chains and get paid for your contract.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>- Explore a corrupt and dark world, meet ambiguous and interesting characters, judge them as friends or foes.<br>- Fight against magical creatures, wild beasts, cursed monsters, witches, sorcerers and professional hunters who are after the prize for your head.<br>- Make your character progression as you wish. Choose from a vast variety of accessories that best serve you in combat.<br>- Be &quot;The Crow&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the sequel</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blood Knot, from the same developer</h2><br>",
            "short_description": "Play as an infamous mercenary known as &quot;The Crow&quot; in a decayed and corrupt world, find your way out of chains and get paid for your contract, in this enthralling Action-RPG with high production values.",
